      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question. i've been having this really annoying gnawing pain in my upper stomach for like a week now, just feels like bad indigestion or something. im taking omeprazole every morning to help with it. i just got a really bad toothache though... is it okay if i take some ibuprofen for the pain? i dont want to mess up my stomach",
